ction–non-detection data, ecological and survey covariates, \r\npredictions, model assessment, and reproducible workflows.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">Participants will work with the </span><strong style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">tsoccu</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"> and </span><strong style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">unmarked</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"> packages through live coding demonstrations, practical exercises, and ecological case studies.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"><strong style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">No prior knowledge of occupancy models is required.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">Best regards,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">Carlo</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:tahoma;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma;font-size:small\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br